<title>USA: Biomatrix CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Biomatrix CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>RIDGEFIELD, N.J. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biomatrix Inc said Tuesday that Brian Hayden, vice president, finance, chief financial officer and treasurer, has resigned to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Biomatrix is conducting a search for a chief financial officer.  In the interim, Rory Riggs, president of Biomatrix, Inc., has assumed the duties of chief financial officer and treasurer.</p>
</text>
